+
+### Profile startup performance
+
+With `--profile-path`, local Firefox instances use separate private temporary
+copies of the supplied profile. This avoids ZIP compression, base64 transfer and
+extraction on every launch. The original profile is never used in-place, and
+cookies, extensions and site storage are retained in each copy. Copies are
+removed on close, reconnect or failed initialization. Remote Selenium sessions
+continue to use the ZIP profile capability.
 
